sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuário / Motorista
    participant Client as App Móvel (Flutter / ApiClient)
    participant Gateway as API Gateway (Express / AuthMiddleware)
    participant Service as AuthService
    participant Bcrypt as Bcrypt Helper
    participant DB as MongoDB (usuarios)

    Note over User, DB: Fluxo de Autenticação Local (E-mail e Senha)
    User->>Client: Informa e-mail e senha
    Client->>Gateway: POST /login { email, senha }
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validar Schema Zod
    Gateway->>Service: login(email, senha)
    Service->>DB: findOne({ email }).select('+senha +refreshtoken')
    DB-->>Service: Dados do Usuário
    Service->>Service: Validar status ativo e email verificado
    Service->>Bcrypt: compare(senhaInformada, hashSenha)
    Bcrypt-->>Service: Senha confere (true)
    Service->>Service: Gerar Access Token (2 min) e Refresh Token (3 dias)
    Service->>DB: updateOne(refreshtoken)
    Service-->>Gateway: { accessToken, refreshToken, usuario }
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK { tokens, usuario }
    Client-->>User: Redireciona para o Cockpit / Home

    Note over User, DB: Renovação Automática via ApiClient (Refresh Token)
    User->>Client: Acessa tela de viagens
    Client->>Gateway: GET /viagens (Token expirado)
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
    Note over Client: ApiClient pausa requisição e solicita refresh
    Client->>Gateway: POST /refresh { refreshToken }
    Gateway->>Service: refreshToken(refreshToken)
    Service->>DB: findById(userId).select('+refreshtoken')
    DB-->>Service: Usuário com token
    Service->>Service: Valida token e emite novo accessToken (2 min)
    Service-->>Gateway: { accessToken }
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK { accessToken }
    Note over Client: Reexecuta requisição GET /viagens com novo token
    Client->>Gateway: GET /viagens (Novo Token)
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK { viagens: [...] }
    Client-->>User: Exibe lista de viagens sem deslogar
